<ReportLayout
  title="Superposition is opinionated noise"
  description="Superposition distillation and input-noise distillation are one knob—perturbing the student's Stage-1 input—and only shared, vocabulary-basis perturbations help."
  eyebrow="Knowledge distillation · working note"
  publishedAt="2026-07-20"
  status="Interim · v3"
>
  <TableOfContents slot="toc">
    <li><a href="#summary"><span class="n">0</span>Summary</a></li>
    <li><a href="#setup"><span class="n">1</span>Setup and noise types</a></li>
    <li><a href="#noise"><span class="n">2</span>One-hot noise</a></li>
    <li><a href="#superposition"><span class="n">3</span>Superposition</a></li>
